* There are now 2 item pedestals in Greed Mode Angel Room #0 (up from 1).
* There is now 1 item pedestal in Greed Mode Angel Room #6 (up from 0).
* There are now 2 item pedestals in Greed Mode Angel Room #1 (up from 1).
* There are now 2 item pedestals in Greed Mode Angel Room #1 (up from 2).
* Fixed the bugged Begotten Chains in Greed Sheol room #31.
* Fixed the bugged Begotten Chain in Greed Sheol room #58.
* Fixed glowing firefly/dust motes getting stuck at the center of L-shaped rooms.

